{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-08-10 04:00:00', 'title': 'JACOBS TO DESIGN KEY SAFETY FEATURE FOR ITER FUSION PROJECT', 'text': "DALLAS, AUG. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JACOBS (NYSE:J) WAS SELECTED TO DESIGN AND DELIVER THE FIRST PLASMA RADIOLOGICAL ENVIRONMENTAL MONITORING SYSTEM (REMS), A KEY SAFETY SYSTEM FOR ITER, THE WORLD'S LARGEST FUSION ENERGY EXPERIMENT. THE FIRST PLASMA REMS, WHICH PROTECTS WORKERS AND THE ENVIRONMENT AGAINST IONIZING RADIATION BY MONITORING RADIOLOGICAL ACTIVITY, IS NEEDED FOR THE MILESTONE MOMENT WHEN ITER STARTS OPERATIONS."}{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-08-09 10:42:00', 'title': 'NATUREWORKS PASSES FINAL AUTHORIZATION MILESTONE FOR NEW FULLY INTEGRATED INGEO PLA MANUFACTURING PLANT IN THAILAND', 'text': 'MINNETONKA, MINN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NATUREWORKS RECEIVES AUTHORIZATION TO INVEST MORE THAN $600 MILLION IN A NEW FULLY INTEGRATED 75,000 TON PER YEAR MANUFACTURING FACILITY.'}